standards and validation thresholds.

F. GKS FILE FORMAT

Chunk layout, index encoding,
compression and version migration.

G. GLOBAL TRUST MODEL

Publisher identity, governance,
signature verification, revocation
and conflict acceptance policies.

H. MODEL SELECTION

Best interpreter model for
structured Task IR generation
under measured resource limits.

I. MEMORY VALIDATION

Prove or revise the target of
approximately 3 GB resident RAM.

J. DISTRIBUTED AVAILABILITY

Pinning, replication and recovery
policies for important snapshots.

K. SECURITY IMPLEMENTATION

Sandbox design, local encryption,
permissions and safe parsing.

These decisions should be resolved
through specifications, prototypes
and measured tests rather than
assumptions.


